  Id: wandering_veterans
  Title: WANDERING VETERANS
  Body: Grizzled archers offer their bows for a warm meal.
  BodyVariants:
  - '{ARCHER_N} bowmen in patched leathers, longbows wrapped in oilcloth. ''Feed
    us and we''ll hold your wall. Or we patch your stonework for directions south,
    and walk.'''
  - "Old soldiers, road-worn but steady-eyed. They'll fight for a full stomach \u2014
    or fix our defenses and move on."
  OutcomeA: "They eat like wolves \u2014 {PAY_N} {PAY_RES} gone \u2014 then take
    the wall without being asked. {ARCHER_N} bows join the watch."
  OutcomeB: They spend the day on the stonework and leave at dusk. Defenses patched
    up by {HEAL_PCT}%.
  Contrast: 3
  OptionAAtomIds:
  - free_archers
  OptionBAtomIds:
  - heal_defense
  OptionAVerb: Feed them
  OptionBVerb: Repairs for directions
  BaseWeight: 0.9
  MinDay: 6
